    {
      "id": "claim_f0ecd434acfe40fa92b6464b4ba4af4f",
      "statement": "Binding a channel allocates a probe descriptor per call and is intended for setup rather than per-frame use; the width comes from the stored channel, so a probe differing only in descriptive metadata still binds correctly.",
      "evidence": [
