        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_13f77efb9be046cf89b1027de896e4e8",
      "statement": "A StateSequence hands out frame views that alias its storage and must never be disposed, and a sequence built over storage someone else allocated — such as an Allocator.Domain array — must never be disposed either, since disposing a sub-array throws.",
